#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/overview.md:35
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Role  | Default                 | Responsibility                                              |\n"
#| "| ----- | ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Hub   | `http://127.0.0.1:2658` | Agent runtime, Hub RPC WebSocket at `/hub/rpc/v1`           |\n"
#| "| Chat  | bundled `/chat`         | Chat UI; shared Hub RPC (no `sap.attach`)                   |\n"
#| "| **Console | bundled shell `/console`  | Memory, config, tools, satellite status (Hub REST `/api/*`) |\n"
msgid ""
"| Role  | Default                 | Responsibility                                              |\n"
"| ----- | ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Hub   | `http://127.0.0.1:2658` | Agent runtime, Hub RPC WebSocket at `/hub/rpc/v1`           |\n"
"| Chat  | bundled `/chat`         | Chat UI; shared Hub RPC (no `sap.attach`)                   |\n"
"| Console | bundled shell `/console`  | Memory, config, tools, satellite status (Hub REST `/api/*`) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 角色  | 默认值                  | 职责                                                        |\n"
"| ----- | ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Hub   | `http://127.0.0.1:2658` | Agent 运行时，Hub RPC WebSocket 端点 `/hub/rpc/v1`          |\n"
"| 聊天室| bundled `/chat`         | 聊天 UI；共享 Hub RPC（无 `sap.attach`）                    |\n"
"| 管理台| bundled shell `/console`  | 记忆、配置、工具、卫星状态（Hub REST `/api/*`）             |\n"

